{"id":7142143048,"name":"Build A Boat With Blocks","desc":"👋 Welcome to Build A Boat With Blocks! 👋\n\n❓How To Play❓\nBuild a boat and set sail! The farther you go, the more cash you earn! Buy blocks and build bigger boats. Your progress is automatically saved!\n\n❕ Please Note:\nThis game is inspired by the popular game \"Build A Boat for Treasure.\" Credit goes to them for the original game idea! Please show your support for their game too! 😄\n\n🌟Have fun building your boat and reaching the end!\n\n💾 Latest Updates! 💾\n\nv1.43.0\n\n-Potion purchase menu was completely revamped\n-Added the \"Cycle\" setting to the time of day toggle\n-Added a setting to hide launch text\n-Main shop purchase preview updates\n\nv1.42.0\n\n-6 new potions sold by an NPC near the cave\n-Private server owners can now use new commands\n-Player status effects are now shown at the bottom of the screen and can be hovered over to learn more\n-Tons of UI revamps and improvements\n\nDevelopment Group:\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/11606484","path":"/game/7142143048-build-a-boat-with-blocks","slug":"7142143048-build-a-boat-with-blocks","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e0a827dec6b8fa47f1aabd88e61c1f20545fd39e8447d83b3da768d2e7295f99.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d5b948a79e22a335b6c2f2b80b4a2277/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":180,"visitor":78961216,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-07-21T18:05:27.188Z","creator":{"name":"robbie6304","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Build-A-Boat-With-Blocks-Ywxo-Hub-Solr-15871","_id":"669d4de71b54c256dd9761ce","title":"Ywxo Hub Solr","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78bfa","gameId":7142143048,"name":"Build A Boat With Blocks","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":7142143048},"features":"Instant Win","tags":["Bu